- FR-AUTH-03: Login shall validate required fields and display appropriate feedback.
- FR-AUTH-04: Password fields shall include show/hide controls.
- FR-AUTH-05: Password recovery shall provide a clear recovery workflow.
- FR-AUTH-06: Users shall be able to view and edit their profile information.
- FR-AUTH-07: Protected actions shall request authentication when necessary.
- FR-AUTH-08: The interface shall provide clear feedback after successful or unsuccessful authentication.

## 3.2 Home Page

**Requirement IDs: FR-HOME-01 to FR-HOME-08**

- FR-HOME-01: The home page shall introduce Property Partner.
- FR-HOME-02: It shall provide a prominent property search interface.
- FR-HOME-03: It shall include navigation to AI Property Designer, AI Property Matchmaker, and AI Connect.
- FR-HOME-04: It shall display featured property listings.
- FR-HOME-05: It shall provide property categories such as houses, apartments, plots, and commercial properties.
- FR-HOME-06: It shall display a clear call to action for buyers and sellers.
- FR-HOME-07: It shall explain the platform's main benefits.
- FR-HOME-08: It shall include a footer with contact information, service links, and policy links.

## 3.3 Property Search and Discovery

**Requirement IDs: FR-SEARCH-01 to FR-SEARCH-10**

- FR-SEARCH-01: Users shall be able to search properties by location.
- FR-SEARCH-02: Users shall be able to filter by minimum and maximum price.
- FR-SEARCH-03: Users shall be able to filter by property type.
- FR-SEARCH-04: Users shall be able to filter by sale or rental status.
- FR-SEARCH-05: Users shall be able to filter by bedrooms, bathrooms, and area.
- FR-SEARCH-06: Users shall be able to sort results by price, newest listings, and relevance.
- FR-SEARCH-07: Results shall be displayed in consistent property cards.
- FR-SEARCH-08: Users shall be able to clear filters.
