## 3.4 Property Details

**Requirement IDs: FR-PROP-01 to FR-PROP-09**

- FR-PROP-01: Each property shall have a dedicated details page.
- FR-PROP-02: The page shall display property photographs.
- FR-PROP-03: It shall display price, location, property type, area, bedrooms, and bathrooms where applicable.
- FR-PROP-04: It shall display the property description and available amenities.
- FR-PROP-05: It shall display seller or agent contact information according to access permissions.
- FR-PROP-06: Buyers shall be able to save properties to favorites.
- FR-PROP-07: Buyers shall be able to initiate a seller inquiry.
- FR-PROP-08: Users shall be able to share a property using available sharing functionality.
