## 3.5 AI Property Matchmaker

**Requirement IDs: FR-MATCH-01 to FR-MATCH-10**

- FR-MATCH-01: The system shall provide a guided property preference form.
- FR-MATCH-02: Users shall be able to enter their budget range.
- FR-MATCH-03: Users shall be able to select a preferred location.
- FR-MATCH-04: Users shall be able to select property type and sale or rental preference.
- FR-MATCH-05: Users shall be able to specify bedrooms, area, and preferred amenities.
- FR-MATCH-06: The system shall validate required preferences.
- FR-MATCH-07: The system shall display properties that match the selected preferences.
- FR-MATCH-08: Results shall display matching reasons, such as price range, location, or property type.
- FR-MATCH-09: Users shall be able to modify their preferences and generate results again.
- FR-MATCH-10: When no suitable properties exist, the system shall suggest relaxing selected filters.

The prototype may use a deterministic matching algorithm over sample listings. It must clearly identify simulated recommendations if a genuine AI service is not connected.

## 3.6 AI Property Designer

**Requirement IDs: FR-DESIGN-01 to FR-DESIGN-11**

- FR-DESIGN-01: The system shall provide an AI Property Designer page.
- FR-DESIGN-02: Users shall be able to upload a property photograph.
