- FR-DESIGN-04: Users shall be able to specify property type and design area.
- FR-DESIGN-05: Users shall be able to choose a design style, such as modern, minimalist, traditional, contemporary, or luxury.
- FR-DESIGN-06: Users shall be able to select a preferred color palette.
- FR-DESIGN-07: Users shall be able to enter additional design requirements.
- FR-DESIGN-08: The system shall validate file type, file size, and required inputs.
- FR-DESIGN-09: The system shall display a processing state when generating or simulating results.
