## 3.7 AI Connect and Communication

**Requirement IDs: FR-CONNECT-01 to FR-CONNECT-12**

- FR-CONNECT-01: The system shall provide an AI Connect information page.
- FR-CONNECT-02: It shall explain the benefits and limitations of connection plans.
- FR-CONNECT-03: It shall display plan prices and access duration.
- FR-CONNECT-04: Users shall be able to select an available plan.
- FR-CONNECT-05: The system shall display the total cost and duration before confirmation.
- FR-CONNECT-06: The prototype shall provide a simulated purchase confirmation workflow.
