Ask representative users to complete common tasks, including finding a property, comparing listings, generating a design concept, and creating a property listing.

Observe task completion, errors, confusion, and user feedback.

## 13.3 Responsive Testing

Test the application at mobile, tablet, and desktop viewport sizes. Confirm that navigation, forms, cards, and buttons remain usable.

## 13.4 Accessibility Testing

Check keyboard navigation, focus visibility, form labels, image alternatives, text contrast, and error-message clarity.

## 13.5 Error Testing

Test empty forms, invalid price ranges, unsupported image formats, no-result searches, expired connections, and failed simulated operations.

